{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_015_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:96ef399695d72adb0f09877fd26af0e5b84c075c25c8ecbc6591b9a6b93fbc03",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:db1fa5c615899befdf806170b40f64ee57aeada1ebe8df01e84d6a19f6e58cb1",
      "text": "虽然这次是爽肤水，但我将来要是也秃了，\n会不会去接拍生发剂的广告啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f01b79b185673822aa3a6265a0cbc563b315e1a24e004926130ba706a9780c41",
      "text": "不管头发变成什么样，龙先生作为偶像的魅力都不会改变的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7f6fd30c37125a054620dbb9a44a69725b7a92da5c4778d9446b7cc731d35f50",
      "text": "要真是那样就好了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:66ccb301b34b96a2f2bdd7d04548ff6e048288baf4446455586ae5bd3ed15d0a",
      "text": "（虽说头发不会影响作为偶像的魅力，\n但消除龙先生的顾虑也是我工作的一部分！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fd7e79c0ecc3f636a09d163ad7b66419f2ee136ab1a678767d071ae539791edc",
      "text": "要是我打听到了对头皮有益的信息，\n会立刻告诉龙先生的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9ce12e7df174cebe84ef39ec934df71051d5b77591931c71cf28c7aead2edad7",
      "text": "哎！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31b3aec154d3929c216475857aff23e9f2f2b183e1a770dd651d4aaa838f04aa",
      "text": "为了让龙先生上了年纪也能堂堂正正地站在舞台上，\n我也会全力协助您的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1bef22b10e6ae766154ffb7fa74f2e4f821173b04e96e5deab4a7e44d11eec76",
      "text": "谢谢你，制作人。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:062828cef5462c2fd7fc7f8e7368bd0392f810bbe790eaa035f6a5818195273c",
      "text": "是啊，既然这次的概念“可靠的男人”\n选了我。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_015ryu_01_1_2_015_01:1_2_015_01_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4fdb308764b9ba9b54517f817986b3339a8ae429ba8cdd47565a6faa5ef6ad86",
      "text": "而且我的头发看来还挺茂密的，\n可不能总依赖别人啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
